# AOSP projects hidden from Soong/Kati (tools/prune-tree.sh). MatonOS never
# builds them; hiding them cuts ~4.5k of ~15.6k Android.bp files from every
# analysis (RAM and time). Paths relative to the AOSP root, one per line.
# Keep tools/rootcanal + tools/netsim (virtual Bluetooth controller for tests).
# Never prune a directory holding a Soong plugin (bootstrap_go_package with
# pluginFor: ["soong_build"]): its module types are used across the tree and
# analysis fails with "unrecognized module type" (test/app_compat: csuite_test;
# device/google/cuttlefish/build). Check: grep -rl pluginFor <dir>.
# Same for team modules (`team {}`, trendy_team_*) and Trusty dirgroups
# (trusty_dirgroup_*: device/generic/trusty, test/vts-testcase) referenced elsewhere.
# Not prunable (real product deps, found via ALLOW_MISSING_DEPENDENCIES
# ninja errors): platform_testing (SystemUI PlatformMotionTestingComposeValues,
# AdServices profile-proto-def), hardware/google (libapf for the network
# stack, hardware.google.bluetooth.* for the Bluetooth APEX).
# Also needed (2026-09-25): cts/libs+common (jsonlib for protologtool),
# packages/services/Car (android.car stubs for PermissionController-lib,
# sdk jars), device/google/cuttlefish/apex (keys of the keymint/gatekeeper/
# strongbox APEXes), device/generic/goldfish (otatools).
# Check after changes: grep "missing dependencies" in out/soong/build.*.ninja.

# Test suites
# cts: only the test dirs (libs/common/root define jsonlib, cts_defaults used by tools)
cts/hostsidetests
cts/tests
test/cts-root
test/vts
test/catbox
test/suite_harness
tools/tradefederation
# Automotive
system/software_defined_vehicle
packages/services/display_safety
device/generic/car
device/google/sdv
device/google/trout
hardware/sdv
# Other devices / emulators
# cuttlefish minus build/ (Soong plugin with module types used elsewhere)
device/google/cuttlefish/common
device/google/cuttlefish/custom_partition
device/google/cuttlefish/guest
device/google/cuttlefish/host
device/google/cuttlefish/recovery
device/google/cuttlefish/shared
device/google/cuttlefish/tests
device/google/cuttlefish/tools

device/google/atv
device/google/contexthub
device/linaro
device/sample
# Other vendors' hardware
hardware/nxp
hardware/st
hardware/qcom
